{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find yourself on a secluded island where nature and time seem to have stopped. There is no rush here - just you, the world around you and endless opportunities for exploration and development. Collect resources, create tools, build structures and solve small tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the secrets of the island and develop your survival skills. There are no enemies here - just you and nature. Enjoy meditative gameplay designed to relax and enthrall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stylized graphics and overhead view</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Calm and relaxing survival without pressure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Varied quests and progression system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Flexible crafting and base expansion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discovering new territories and secrets of the island</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3695140?t=1758829023","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3695140?t=1758829023","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695140/abeb75a4ebfa9093fb0e3d5a0c33914d2f8abf09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758829023","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695140/abeb75a4ebfa9093fb0e3d5a0c33914d2f8abf09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758829023","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find yourself on a secluded island where nature and time seem to have stopped. There is no rush here - just you, the world around you and endless opportunities for exploration and development. Collect resources, create tools, build structures and solve small tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the secrets of the island and develop your survival skills. There are no enemies here - just you and nature. Enjoy meditative gameplay designed to relax and enthrall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stylized graphics and overhead view</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Calm and relaxing survival without pressure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Varied quests and progression system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Flexible crafting and base expansion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discovering new territories and secrets of the island</p>","developers":["TornikeGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695140/9b8dcca6f4d6222b930ee42c3969dd9ac3cb19de/header.jpg?t=1758829023","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3695140/307104058/f34f91752e835edbf3a28906257e575c26d65dfa/1758202560/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758295162","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3695140/307104058/f34f91752e835edbf3a28906257e575c26d65dfa/1758202560/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758295162","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3695140/307104058/f34f91752e835edbf3a28906257e575c26d65dfa/1758202560/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758295162","id":257201227,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257201227/movie480.mp4?t=1758295162","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257201227/movie_max.mp4?t=1758295162"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257201227/728362f39bdea560